---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="about" label="about" title="Ope, hi.">
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about__text">
      <p>
        I'm Chris. I taught myself HTML and CSS by breaking MySpace layouts in 2005 and never really stopped. Over
        fifteen years later I build products for a living and more of them for fun: apps, websites, and lately a lot
        of AI tooling, from northeast Ohio.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work it's mountain bikes, a Onewheel, snowboarding when the lake effect cooperates, and a lot of
        time in Apple Vision Pro and VR, playing, working, and building for it. Spatial and immersive tech is where
        my curiosity is right now. I also say "ope" more than is strictly necessary.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 18rem) 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-12);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about__photo {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    background: var(--k2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about__photo {
      display: none;
    }
    .about__text {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
    }
  }
</style>
